From 7aca1e5fa2a8090438cc6cbfd478b68e9625eac7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:31:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): negotiate containment and expose terminal
 handoff [daveey]

Require authenticated compatible Board capability before canonical I/O; never fall back locally. Expose both operations to worker tools and the native MCP transport, recognizing only successful own-run containment as terminal. Retain dependency and source-receipt custody.

Proof: canonical containment/site 15 files 290 passed; stop/capability/site 5 files 61 passed; broader exposure consumers initially caught catalog truncation, corrected and rerun green; real isolated workerd/core proof 33 checks passed including restart, replica pages, rehome and producer freshness. Full scripts/check passed. Not deployed, no live lifecycle application. Independent final review, remaining mutation/replay, CI and canonical landing remain required.
